'''Ice''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Knife Box 1]] or through trading. 

==Appearance==
This knife resembles a chunk of ice, hence the name. It’s blade uses a frosty blue coloring, and the guard plus the handle instead are an icy blue.

==Trivia==
*This knife is commonly paired with the gun [[Cold]].
*[https://www.roblox.com/users/465456/profile/ DesDesNeverDie] is the creator of this knife.
*The original name of this knife is "Plasma Knife"
*This knife, along with many other knives are from other Murder games.
*The description of this knife is: "Unlocks 'Secret Plasma Powers'. Ha Ha! Just kidding."<ref>[https://www.roblox.com/library/161313709/SKIN-Plasma-Knife Model created by DesDesNeverDie]</ref>

